t></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">梯度液面</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">真实计算当前结果</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">单列阈值</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">相同输入对照</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"3\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">结果与工况是否一致？</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">记录与工况复核</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">保留异常与分歧</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">候选与单位</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">输出可复查记录</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">同分母比较</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">最后读取独立参考</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 145\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"获取观察窗的数据流\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#365c4e\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eeea\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">32×100 灰度图</text><path d=\"M181 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"199\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0e9\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"281\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">固定机位与标尺</text><path d=\"M364 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"382\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#deeae4\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"464\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">每行对应高度</text><path d=\"M547 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"565\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f1eadc\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"647\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">像素不含答案</text></g></svg><figcaption>把检测对象限定为可解释的标尺观察窗。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 145\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"提取液面的数据流\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#365c4e\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eeea\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">列方向中位数</text><path d=\"M181 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"199\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0e9\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"281\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">相邻行梯度</text><path d=\"M364 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"382\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#deeae4\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"464\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">峰位置 y</text><path d=\"M547 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"565\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f1eadc\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"647\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">高度 h 与强度</text></g></svg><figcaption>展示像素到读数的计算链。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 145\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"交叉核查的数据流\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#365c4e\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eeea\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">视觉液位 h</text><path d=\"M181 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"199\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0e9\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"281\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">独立雷达读数</text><path d=\"M364 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"382\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#deeae4\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"464\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">差值超过0.6 m</text><path d=\"M547 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"565\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f1eadc\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"647\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">保留测量分歧</text></g></svg><figcaption>区分一致与可靠是两回事。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 145\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"多帧评价的数据流\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#365c4e\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e2eeea\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18 帧照明变化</text><path d=\"M181 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"199\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#edf0e9\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"281\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">逐帧像素识别</text><path d=\"M364 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"382\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#deeae4\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"464\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">单列阈值基线</text><path d=\"M547 67h17l-5 -4m5 4l-5 4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#678a7c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"565\" y=\"35\" width=\"165\" height=\"65\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f1eadc\" stroke=\"#9ab5a8\"/><text x=\"647\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"middle\">最后计算 MAE</text></g></svg><figcaption>观察噪声、照明变化下的误差。</figcaption></figure>"
